OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Sky Blues fans need to know
OL,4,Aabout the club's new digital ticketing
OL,5,Asystem
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe last time Coventry City fans were
OL,8,Fin the Premier League, Apple launched
OL,9,FiTunes, allowing users to buy music and
OL,10,Fplay it on their portable devices.
OL,11,FBuying a match day ticket to watch Sky
OL,12,FBlues, though, still meant handing over
OL,13,Fphysical cash in return for a paper
OL,14,Fticket.
OL,16,FTwenty-five years later, and due to
OL,17,Frequirements from the Premier League,
OL,18,Ftickets are now digital and downloaded
OL,19,Fto phones and other mobile tech.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
