OL,3,GNEWSAWhat Sky Blues fans need to know
OL,4,Aabout the club's new digital ticketing
OL,5,Asystem
OL,6,
OL,7,FHowever, it has led to some confusion
OL,8,Fover how the digital ticketing system
OL,9,Foperates. There has been just one game
OL,10,Fat the CBS Arena so far this season,
OL,11,Fwhich means supporters are still
OL,12,Fgetting to grips with how the new
OL,13,Fscheme works.
OL,15,FIn response, BBC CWR has compiled the
OL,16,Ffollowing guide to what fans need to
OL,17,Fknow, particularly around the issue of
OL,18,Ftransferring tickets.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
